<%# A production's next date on Ticketing home (Tim, 2026-10-16: the rows were
    cluttered): its wide image, when, what, how it's selling, its sales
    status only when it isn't plainly on sale, and Work the door while that
    show's door is open. From sm up: the picture, the title over its time,
    how it's selling and the button beside them. On a phone (Tim,
    2026-10-16: too squeezed, and the button dropped to its own line): the
    picture down the left, then two short lines in smaller type, when and the
    sold count on the first, the title and the button on the second, the
    title giving way to the button rather than wrapping. Locals: listing, stats. %>
<%
  starts = listing.show.date_and_time
  when_words = starts.to_date == Date.current ? "Tonight · #{starts.strftime('%-l:%M %p')}" : starts.strftime("%a, %b %-d · %-l:%M %p")
  label, badge_classes = ticket_listing_status_badge(listing, stats.inventory)
  door_open = DoorTonight.door_open?(listing)
  # A mini bar under the sold words (Tim, 2026-10-16), the same math as the
  # drawer's date lines, on every screen size (Tim liked it on desktop and
  # wanted it on his phone too).
  seats = stats.seats_to_sell
  percent = seats.to_i.positive? ? [ (stats.sold_anywhere * 100.0 / seats).round, 100 ].min : (seats&.zero? ? 100 : nil)
%>
<%# On a phone the grid places these by column and row: the picture spans
    both rows, then when and the sold count, then the title and the button. %>
<div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 sm:px-5 grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] gap-x-3 gap-y-0.5 items-center sm:flex sm:gap-4">
  <div class="row-span-2 sm:row-span-1">
    <%= render "shared/wide_thumb", image: listing.show.wide_image_for_rows, name: listing.display_title, width: "w-16 sm:w-24" %>
  </div>
  <div class="contents sm:block sm:flex-1 sm:min-w-0">
    <span class="col-start-2 row-start-1 block text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 whitespace-nowrap"><%= when_words %></span>
    <%= link_to listing.display_title, manage_ticket_listing_path(listing), class: "col-start-2 row-start-2 block min-w-0 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-semibold text-gray-900 truncate hover:text-pink-700" %>
  </div>
  <span class="col-start-3 row-start-1 text-right text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">
    <%= stats.sold_words %>
    <% if percent %>
      <span class="block mt-1 ml-auto h-1.5 w-24 rounded-full bg-gray-100" title="<%= percent %>% sold"><span class="block h-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-500" style="width: <%= percent %>%"></span></span>
    <% end %>
    <% unless label == "On sale" %><span class="block mt-1 text-xs font-medium <%= badge_classes[/text-\S+/] %>"><%= label %></span><% end %>
  </span>
  <% if door_open %>
    <div class="col-start-3 row-start-2 justify-self-end sm:flex-shrink-0">
      <%= render "shared/button", text: "Work the door", variant: "primary", size: "small", path: door_path(listing) %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
